                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_1112876064">Service_Relevant</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_149235657">All wiring needs to be checked. If error persits RSHM needs replacement</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_642568521">1. Local voltage is within normal range (9-16V)/Ignition ON or ECU is awake2.  De-bounce timer = 5 sec</SD>
